explanation:
```sql
CREATE INDEX ON orders (customer_id) INCLUDE (total, created_at);
SELECT created_at, total FROM orders WHERE customer_id = 42;
```
PostgreSQL caveat: index-only scans still consult the visibility map and visit the heap for pages not marked all-visible (shown as `Heap Fetches`). MongoDB caveat: exclude `_id` from the projection unless it's in the index.
